# Vendored buildkit protos

The proto files under `proto/` are the buildkit protocol definitions (fetched
from the moby/buildkit checkout at ~/Projects/github.com/moby/buildkit; they
match the snapshot vendored by buildkit-client's build script). They are
compiled by `build.rs` with tonic-build 0.12 — the SAME tonic version
buildkit-client uses — so the generated `LLBBridge` client accepts a
buildkit-client `Channel`. This is how basil runs as a frontend-less gateway
bridge to attach image config (see docs/DESIGN.md).

Do not edit these by hand; regenerate from the upstream proto tree when
upgrading buildkit-client.